{"seq":29,"slug":"haskell-pure-functional","title":"Haskell 与纯函数式编程","stage":"DONE","category":"languages","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/haskell-pure-functional","rating":{"composite":3.61,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3,"positioning":null,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# Haskell 与纯函数式编程\n\n把一门语言「纯」到极致，会发生什么？Haskell 给出的答案是：函数不再是一段会偷偷改动世界的指令，而是一个像数学等式那样、给定输入必给定输出的映射。这个看似苛刻的约束反而打开了一整套别处难得的能力——表达式可以放心替换、副作用被类型系统逼到明面上、求值顺序成了可以雕琢的资源。理解 Haskell，本质上是理解「当你不允许偷偷搞事情时，程序还能怎么组织」。\n\n本 hub 用四章把这条线讲透，刻意按「越来越能落地」的顺序铺开，而不是按教科书的章节堆叠。\n\n第一章「基础」打地基：先讲清楚纯函数式的世界观与 Haskell 为何如此设计，再把「引用透明 + 惰性求值」这对让 Haskell 与众不同的组合拆开看，最后建立类型作为思考工具的初步直觉。没有这三块，后面所有抽象都会变成死记硬背。\n\n第二章「抽象」是全 hub 的心脏。类型类给了「按类型分派行为」的机制，Functor 与 Applicative 描述「在容器里计算」的递进阶梯，Monad 则把「带上下文的顺序计算」统一成一个接口。这三篇是层层咬合的：不懂类型类就讲不了 Functor，不理解 Applicative 的局限就理解不了 Monad 为什么必须存在。\n\n第三章「类型系统」往深处走：代数数据类型是建模的砖石，高阶类型解释了为什么 `Maybe` 可以「缺一个类型参数」地存在，高级扩展（GADTs、类型族、依赖类型方向）则展示 Haskell 把不变量编码进类型、让非法状态根本无法表达的野心。\n\n第四章「实践」收口落地：IO 如何在纯语言里安放副作用、惰性带来的性能陷阱怎么用严格性和性能分析驯服、以及 2026 年真实的 GHC/Cabal/Stack/HLS 工具链长什么样。学到这里，你不只懂理论，还能把一个 Haskell 项目跑起来、调起来、优化起来。\n\n四章之间不是孤岛：抽象章会反复回指基础章的纯度概念，类型系统章会用抽象章的类型类讲高阶类型，实践章的 IO 正是 Monad 最重要的一个实例。建议顺序通读，遇到交叉链接顺手跳过去补全脉络。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/haskell-pure-functional/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"haskell-philosophy","title":"Haskell 哲学与纯函数式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/haskell-pure-functional/foundations/haskell-philosophy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"purity-laziness","title":"纯度与惰性求值","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/haskell-pure-functional/foundations/purity-laziness"},{"seq":3,"slug":"types-basics","title":"类型基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/haskell-pure-functional/foundations/types-basics"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"abstractions","title":"抽象","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/haskell-pure-functional/abstractions","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"typeclasses","title":"类型类","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/haskell-pure-functional/abstractions/typeclasses"},{"seq":2,"slug":"functors-applicatives","title":"Functor 与 Applicative","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/haskell-pure-functional/abstractions/functors-applicatives"},{"seq":3,"slug":"monads","title":"Monad 单子","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/haskell-pure-functional/abstractions/monads"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"type-system","title":"类型系统","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/haskell-pure-functional/type-system","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"algebraic-types","title":"代数数据类型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/haskell-pure-functional/type-system/algebraic-types"},{"seq":2,"slug":"higher-kinded","title":"高阶类型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/haskell-pure-functional/type-system/higher-kinded"},{"seq":3,"slug":"advanced-extensions","title":"高级类型扩展","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/haskell-pure-functional/type-system/advanced-extensions"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/haskell-pure-functional/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"io-effects","title":"IO 与效应管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/haskell-pure-functional/practice/io-effects"},{"seq":2,"slug":"performance-evaluation","title":"性能与求值控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/haskell-pure-functional/practice/performance-evaluation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ecosystem-tooling","title":"生态与工具链","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/haskell-pure-functional/practice/ecosystem-tooling"}]}]}